RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_MrFuji::
	.string "By the way, be careful.\p"
	.string "The mother KANGASKHAN is also\n"
	.string "looking for its child.$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_HikerYuzoIntro::
	.string "Huh? Who are you?\n"
	.string "What are you doing here?$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_HikerYuzoDefeat::
	.string "I was only exploring this place.$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_HikerYuzo::
	.string "I wonder what that rock is doing\n"
	.string "there?$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_LaprasDoll::
	.string "{PLAYER} tries to move the rock.\p"
	.string "Not even STRENGTH would work with\n"
	.string "this one.$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_Trigger1::
	.string "Oh, excuse me, young one...\p"
	.string "Have you seen a baby KANGASKHAN\n"
	.string "somewhere around the ROCK TUNNEL?\p"
	.string "We were taking care of its\n"
	.string "injuries, but then a thief broke in\l"
	.string "and headed towards this tunnel.\p"
	.string "Well, if you happen to run into\n"
	.string "them, could you help us stop them?\l"
	.string "Thanks!$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_Trigger2_1::
	.string "ASHLEE: Just come here, little\n"
	.string "baby.\l"
	.string "We don’t want to hurt you...$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_Trigger2_2::
	.string "ASHLEE: Come on... Don’t be\n"
	.string "afraid, you can trust us...$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_Trigger2_3::
	.string "ASHLEE: NOW, PIKACHU! GO GET IT!$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_Trigger2_4::
	.string "ASHLEE: Yes, we finally caught it!\n"
	.string "Good work PIKACHU!\p"
	.string "Now all we need to do is wait till\n"
	.string "that mother KANGASKHAN shows up.$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_Trigger2_5::
	.string "ASHLEE: Argh!\p"
	.string "Why do you always scare me like\n"
	.string "that?\p"
	.string "You’ve come to rescue the baby\n"
	.string "KANGASKHAN, huh?\p"
	.string "Yeah! Like if we would let you!\p"
	.string "Get ready for a b...$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_Trigger2_6::
	.string "ASHLEE: What the...?\p"
	.string "It’s the KANGASKHAN!\p"
	.string "But... but... It really looks\n"
	.string "mad...$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_Trigger2_7::
	.string "ASHLEE: Well, I think we can skip\n"
	.string "this plan, don’t you think,\l"
	.string "PIKACHU?$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_Trigger2_8::
	.string "ASHLEE: I think you are right,\n"
	.string "better RUN!$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_Trigger2_9::
	.string "Listen to me KANGASKHAN, we just\n"
	.string "were taking care of your baby’s\l"
	.string "injuries.$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_Trigger2_10::
	.string "I guess it’s no use, the KANGASKHAN\n"
	.string "is furious!\p"
	.string "You’ll have to battle it!\p"
	.string "But please, don’t be too rude on it!$"

RockTunnel_Cave2_Text_Trigger2_11::
	.string "At least the KANGASKHAN will be\n"
	.string "able to rest.\p"
	.string "By the way, my name is FUJI.\n"
	.string "I live in LAVENDER taking care of\l"
	.string "sick and injured abandoned POKéMON.\p"
	.string "Pay me a visit whenever you want.$"
